From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: bsp2020 <bsp2020@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 14:46:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 36/36] moe cache: KV segment -- GGML_MOE_KV_SEG_PF on by
 default with the segment

The A/B on the production config (FINDINGS 943) gave small-prompt prefill
+3..4 % and midpf prefill +0.8 %, decode unchanged, output identical
(GGML_MOE_VERIFY 0 differ).  GGML_MOE_KV_SEG_PF=0 turns it off.
---
 ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-expert-tier.inc | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-expert-tier.inc b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-expert-tier.inc
index ac1f4f4b7..5c925517b 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-expert-tier.inc
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/moe-expert-tier.inc
@@ -2355,14 +2355,14 @@ static __global__ void moe_cache_route_kernel(char * __restrict__ dst, const cha
 // Where a device-side copy reads expert `e`: its arena slot, its RAM-tier slot (both contiguous, cold 0), or the
 // registered alias of the sparse master with the host geometry (cold 1, registered here).  False: a RAM-tier table
 // without a slot for `e`, or an alias that cannot be registered.
-// GGML_MOE_KV_SEG_PF=1 (default off; needs the KV segment): a small prefill ubatch, which passes the `stream` its copy
+// GGML_MOE_KV_SEG_PF (default on with the KV segment, =0 off): a small prefill ubatch, which passes the `stream` its copy
 // runs on, reads an expert's KV-segment copy (contiguous, cold 0, the same bytes) before the RAM tier or the file: a
 // device-to-device copy.  Only on the stream that writes and reuses those slots, so the read is ordered against them,
 // and not a slot a queued fill job still writes or a fill has pinned.  Nothing of the policy's state is touched.
 // n_src (optional) counts the expert by source: arena, KV copy, RAM tier, file.  A usable KV copy counts as one with
 // the switch off too (the source is then the RAM tier / file as before), so the report sizes what the switch would move.
 static bool kvl_seg_pf_on() {
-    static const bool v = kvl_seg_on() && getenv("GGML_MOE_KV_SEG_PF") != nullptr && atoi(getenv("GGML_MOE_KV_SEG_PF")) > 0;
+    static const bool v = kvl_seg_on() && (getenv("GGML_MOE_KV_SEG_PF") == nullptr || atoi(getenv("GGML_MOE_KV_SEG_PF")) > 0);
     return v;
 }
 static int64_t g_pf_src_n[4] = {};   // small prefill ubatches: experts staged from the arena, a KV copy, the RAM tier, the file
-- 
2.53.0

